          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.246,
            0.84,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "§ **Any assignment not in a function definition**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.558,
            0.264,
            0.741,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": "§ Also **modules & functions!**"
